  platform selection, zone transfer design, hybrid architecture). No content duplication: this
  skill covers BIND configuration mechanics; dns-network-ops covers the conceptual and
  comparative layer that applies across all DNS platforms.
  unbound-dns-ops owns recursive-resolver-only hardening, DNSSEC validation, and privacy features.
  No dns-network-ops content copied into this skill; routing callouts direct to dns-network-ops
  for design questions.

